+`moai worktree new <name>` is the harness-neutral L1 creation verb — it materializes a tree without entering it. A Codex factory lane uses it for each card, then launches the interactive card session with `codex -C <absolute-worktree-path>`; it does not use `moai codex -w` to create the tree. The Codex app's Worktree selector creates a Codex-managed tree separately. A raw `git worktree add` bypasses MoAI's name validation, base selection, and post-create Git configuration.
